2. Hardware design files  --  MIT License (same text as section 1)
   Applies to: everything under hardware/ and the KiCad files, libraries
   (TMR2615D symbol and footprint), schematics, board layouts, gerber zips,
   bills of materials and placement files it contains, and schematics/.
   You may build, modify and sell boards from these files. The sensor symbol
   and footprint describe a part made by MDT; the part name and datasheet belong
   to its maker. Nothing here has been certified (no FCC, CE or USB-IF testing).
   The designs are provided as is. Check them yourself before ordering boards.

