     vendor ID (USB-IF membership) or a licensed product ID range first.
   - "STM32", "ST", "Arm", "Cortex", "CMSIS", "KiCad", "QMK", "JLCPCB", "LCSC",
     "MDT" and other names belong to their owners and are used only to describe
     compatibility.
